cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this package, please cite it. Citing the package does not replace citing the
  OBIS datasets you used; generate those with `OBISClient.citations(result)`.
title: "OBISClient.jl: a Julia client for the Ocean Biodiversity Information System"
abstract: >-
  An independent Julia client for the OBIS (Ocean Biodiversity Information System) API, a
  programme of the Intergovernmental Oceanographic Commission of UNESCO. Not affiliated
  with or endorsed by OBIS, the IOC, or UNESCO. Provides a stable typed schema
  across queries, licence and citation metadata carried on results, streaming and resumable
  pagination, an optional reproducibility cache, and access to absence and dropped records.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Dante
    family-names: Bertuzzi
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-5223-2814"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dantebertuzzi/OBISClient.jl"
url: "https://dantebertuzzi.github.io/OBISClient.jl"
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
keywords:
  - marine biodiversity
  - biodiversity informatics
  - Darwin Core
  - OBIS
  - Julia
references:
